new file mode 100644
index 0000000..6f3c2a1
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/backups.md
@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+# Backups
+
+atlas backs up `/var/lib/paperless`, `/var/lib/vaultwarden` and `/home/mira/Documents` to the
+restic repository on the backup box (`sftp:restic@192.0.2.50:/srv/restic/atlas`) every night at
+02:30, with up to 45 minutes of random delay so it doesn't collide with the box's own scrub.
+
+Paperless's consume folder and any `.cache` directories are excluded.
+
+Retention: 7 daily, 4 weekly and 6 monthly snapshots. Pruning runs after each backup.
+
+The repository password is the `restic_password` sops secret (`secrets/atlas.yaml`).
+
+## Checking a backup
+
+```sh
+sudo restic-nightly snapshots
+sudo restic-nightly check
+```
+
+## Restoring
+
+```sh
+sudo restic-nightly restore latest --target /tmp/restore --include /var/lib/paperless
+```
+
